Then his dray-horſe and he, in the ſtreets we did ſee,
With his hanger, his ſling, and bis jacket;
Long time he did watch, to meet with his match;
For he'd ever a mind to the plack

he must dree his weird;
Renounce all blessings for that imprecation,
Steal forth and haunt that builded desolation,
